1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,432
Have you ever noticed how the world around you
changes like a giant magic show?

2
00:00:04,432 --> 00:00:07,389
Let’s explore the incredible story of seasons
and weather together!

3
00:00:07,389 --> 00:00:08,928
It all starts with Earth

4
00:00:08,928 --> 00:00:09,605
like a big

5
00:00:09,605 --> 00:00:10,343
spinning top

6
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:12,736
As Earth tilts and dances around the sun

7
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:14,778
it changes the way the sun’s warmth

8
00:00:14,778 --> 00:00:16,777
touches different parts of the world

9
00:00:16,777 --> 00:00:19,141
This tilt is what makes the seasons happen

10
00:00:19,141 --> 00:00:20,144
First comes spring

11
00:00:20,144 --> 00:00:22,097
like a gentle wake-up call for nature

12
00:00:22,097 --> 00:00:23,196
Plants begin to bloom

13
00:00:23,196 --> 00:00:25,940
almost like they're yawning and stretching after a
long

14
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,940
nap

15
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:31,486
You might see flowers peeking out and animals
like bunnies hopping around

16
00:00:31,486 --> 00:00:33,487
excited to play in the sunshine

17
00:00:33,487 --> 00:00:33,783
Then

18
00:00:33,783 --> 00:00:35,320
as we move around the sun

19
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,146
summer arrives

20
00:00:36,146 --> 00:00:38,512
It’s like the world turned up the heat!

21
00:00:38,512 --> 00:00:40,139
The days are long and bright

22
00:00:40,139 --> 00:00:42,945
perfect for building sandy castles at the beach or

23
00:00:42,945 --> 00:00:45,014
eating chilly ice creams to keep cool

24
00:00:45,014 --> 00:00:45,274
Next

25
00:00:45,274 --> 00:00:46,728
the tilt takes us to autumn

26
00:00:46,728 --> 00:00:48,493
where leaves change their outfits

27
00:00:48,493 --> 00:00:48,856
turning

28
00:00:48,856 --> 00:00:51,811
bright orange and red before gently falling to the
ground

29
00:00:51,811 --> 00:00:55,322
It’s a time for gathering nuts and jumping in
leaf piles

30
00:00:55,322 --> 00:00:56,246
as the air gets

31
00:00:56,246 --> 00:00:58,246
crisper and cooler

32
00:00:58,246 --> 00:00:58,661
Finally

33
00:00:58,661 --> 00:00:59,491
we reach winter

34
00:00:59,491 --> 00:01:02,088
where everything feels like it’s covered in a soft

35
00:01:02,088 --> 00:01:04,087
fluffy blanket

36
00:01:04,087 --> 00:01:06,048
Snowflakes twirl down like little dancers

37
00:01:06,048 --> 00:01:07,635
and the world becomes a playground

38
00:01:07,635 --> 00:01:09,635
for snowmen and icy fun

39
00:01:09,635 --> 00:01:11,343
As you watch the seasons change

40
00:01:11,343 --> 00:01:13,477
remember that each one lasts about three

41
00:01:13,477 --> 00:01:15,477
months

42
00:01:15,477 --> 00:01:19,614
And just like how every day the weather might
surprise you with rain or

43
00:01:19,614 --> 00:01:20,058
sunshine

44
00:01:20,058 --> 00:01:21,980
each season has its own special feeling

